{title: Tumhe Kaise Main Bataoon}
{artist: Dastak Abhijeet Rajesh Roshan}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Tumhe kaise main bataun
[D#]Tumhe kaise [D]main kahu
[D]Mere bas mein agar ho to
[Cm]Main bas [Gm]itna hi karun
[Gm]Tumhe din bhar Tumhe har pal
[Cm]Dekhta hi main rahu
[F]Tumhe dekhu,Tumhe chahoon
[D]Tumhe punju har pal
[D#]Tumhe sochu ,Tumhe samjhu
[Cm]Tumhe Mangu har pal
[D]Tumhe gungunau Tumhe [Gm]gau har pal
[Gm]Main tumhara [Cm]hun aisa
[D]Deewana [Gm]meri jaan
[Gm]Mera marna bhi tumhi ho
[D#]Mera jeena [D]bhi ho tum
[D]Meri madira bhi tumhi ho
[Cm]Mera pina [Gm]bhi ho tum
[Gm]Mera chandi bhi tumhi ho
[Cm]Mera sona bhi ho tum
[F]Mera hasna bhi tumhi ho
[D]Mera rona bhi ho tum
[D#]Meri sari saason mein
[Cm]Tum jaise ho ghuli
[D]Meri aankhen tumhe dekhe
[Gm]Chahe band ho ya khuli
[Gm]Main tumhara [Cm]hun aisa...
[Gm]Meri dil mein hai yeh armaan
[D#]Tumhe ek [D]din main paau
[D]Iss ambar se bhi aage
[Cm]tumhein [Gm]lekar jaau
[Gm]Jahan raahon mein ho bekhre
[Cm]sab chand aur taare
[F]Jahan geeton ke behte ho
[D]meethe dhaare
[D#]Jahan khwaabo ki duniya
[Cm]kabhi soyi nahi ho
[D]Jaha tum ho jaha mai [Gm]hu aur koi nahi ho
[Gm]Main tumhara [Cm]hun aisa...
